{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>Also this time.</b> As He did with the frogs — even though he ought to have feared the imminent plague of the firstborn that did not merely depart but killed — yet he treated this lightly in his eyes, to restore him."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {0 "Reading ה׳ as HaShem; the subject of נקל is Pharaoh, who treated the warning lightly despite what was yet to come."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:24:51.501092537Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}